  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PROTECTING HUMAN RIGHTS OF WOMEN &amp; GIRLS &amp;VULNERABLE PEOPLE IN RURALS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Protecting Human Rights Through Active Citizenry&#x2014;Particularly The Rights of Women and Girls and Vulnerable People in Rural Communities project aims to contribute to building local agency by strengthening local development agencies (LDAs) efforts to promote gender equality and address GBV. The objectives of the project are to partner with rural LDAs to build strong institutions that are able to respond to the cross-cutting issues of access to justice and gender for rural community-based organizations. The key activities include sub-granting to rural LDAs that focus on human rights, gender, and GBV.</narrative>
  </description>
